        "title": "CISP-Project-Management-Basics",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/CISP-Project-Management-Basics/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": ":::anote{title=\"项目的定义\"}↵**项目是：**↵为达到特定目的↵使用一定资源↵在确定的期间内↵为特定发起人↵提供独特的产品、服务或成果↵进行的一次性努力↵**项目的关键要素：**↵:::↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "CISP-Project-Management-Basics",
        "title": "CISP-Project-Management-Basics",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/CISP-Project-Management-Basics/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "**项目的关键特征：**↵ ↵**特征详解：**↵| 特征 | 说明 | 示例 |↵|------|------|------|↵| 临时性 | 有明确的开始和结束日期 | 信息安全系统建设项目：2024年1月-6月 |↵| 独特性 | 产品或服务具有独特性 | 为特定企业定制的安全解决方案 |↵| 渐进明细 | 随着项目推进逐步完善 | 需求分析→设计→开发→测试→部署 |↵| 目标明确 | 遵循SMART原则 | 3个月内实施多因素认证系统 |",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "CISP-Project-Management-Basics",
        "title": "CISP-Project-Management-Basics",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/CISP-Project-Management-Basics/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "**关于项目的理解：**↵| 说法 | 正确性 | 说明 |↵|------|--------|------|↵| A.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "CISP-Project-Management-Basics",
        "title": "CISP-Project-Management-Basics",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/CISP-Project-Management-Basics/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "项目是一次性努力 | ✅ 正确 | 项目有明确的开始和结束 |↵| B.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "CISP-Project-Management-Basics",
        "title": "CISP-Project-Management-Basics",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/CISP-Project-Management-Basics/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "结束日期随机确定 | ❌ 错误 | 结束日期应在规划时确定 |↵| C.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "CISP-Project-Management-Basics",
        "title": "CISP-Project-Management-Basics",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/CISP-Project-Management-Basics/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "项目资源指人财物 | ✅ 正确 | 包括人力、资金、物资等 |↵| D.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "CISP-Project-Management-Basics",
        "title": "CISP-Project-Management-Basics",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/CISP-Project-Management-Basics/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "目标遵守SMART原则 | ✅ 正确 | 具体、可测量、一致同意、现实、有时限 |",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "CISP-Project-Management-Basics",
        "title": "CISP-Project-Management-Basics",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/CISP-Project-Management-Basics/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": ":::warning{title=\"项目结束日期的确定\"}↵**项目时间管理的核心原则：**↵项目有明确的开始日期和结束日期↵结束日期应在项目规划阶段确定↵结束日期不是随机决定的↵项目管理强调计划性和可预测性↵**时间调整的正确方式：**↵可能根据实际情况进行调整↵调整应基于科学的评估↵需要变更管理流程↵需要相关方批准↵:::",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "CISP-Project-Management-Basics",
        "title": "CISP-Project-Management-Basics",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/CISP-Project-Management-Basics/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "**项目目标的SMART原则：**↵",
